ends on institution and licensing."},{"type":"h","text":"Process Integration"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how individual processes interact."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Lithography","Etching","Deposition","Doping","Annealing","Metallization","Device Performance"]},{"type":"p","text":"Changing one process can affect several downstream device parameters."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Projects"}]},{"heading":"CMOS Process-Flow Simulation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Create a simulated CMOS fabrication process covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wafer"},{"text":"Oxidation"},{"text":"Lithography"},{"text":"Etching"},{"text":"Doping"},{"text":"Metallization"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Document each process and expected device structure."}]},{"heading":"Thin-Film Deposition Study","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Investigate how deposition parameters affect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Thickness"},{"text":"Surface morphology"},{"text":"Electrical properties"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use experimental or simulated data."}]},{"heading":"Nano-Device Characterization","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Analyze I-V or C-V characteristics of a fabricated or laboratory-provided device."},{"type":"p","text":"Extract:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Resistance"},{"text":"Threshold voltage"},{"text":"Leakage"},{"text":"Capacitance"},{"text":"Other relevant device parameters"}]}]},{"heading":"Process-Variation Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Create a statistical model examining the effect of process variations on device performance."},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"h","text":"Python / MATLAB + statistical analysis"}]},{"heading":"MEMS/NEMS Fabrication Project","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop a simplified fabrication flow for a:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pressure sensor"},{"text":"Accelerometer"},{"text":"Resonator"},{"text":"Microfluidic de